# Local, gitignored config that Claude Code copies into every new git worktree
# it creates (`claude --worktree`, `EnterWorktree`, `isolation: worktree`
# subagents). Uses .gitignore syntax; only files that match here AND are
# gitignored are copied, so tracked files are never duplicated.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading "/" so they only pick up the repo-root
# copies, not stray matches like tmp/bak/.env.shared.
#
# Do NOT add .venv/ or data/ here:
#   .venv/  ~3 GB, and its editable-install .pth points at the src/ tree of the
#           checkout it was built in -- a copy would import the main checkout
#           and defeat the worktree's isolation.
#   data/   ~1.6 GB of runtime output.
# Run ./scripts/setup-worktree.sh inside the worktree to build these instead.

/.env.shared
/.env.private
/.env.docker
/.python-version
